WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.300
I can definitely say that after the accident,

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.100
the injury sustained, you know,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.960
the C6 to C7 vertebrae,
that location of the spine,

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:14.180
I had paralysis in the right pectoral,

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.360
my whole arm, complete lack of movement.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.880
I had a bone graft on my hip.
I remember being completely bed-bound,

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:25.860
couldn't move, couldn't raise my neck,

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.080
couldn't even turn it fully.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.680
I had quite a handful of sessions over the
last five to six months with Nizam himself,

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:38.640
and I can definitely say that
it's been life-changing treatment.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.900
I thought I wouldn't be able to move again.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:46.360
My hand had a complete loss of mobility.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:50.520
I couldn't move it, it was completely
paralysed, and now I have function

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.640
in my entire hand, my arm, there's strength.
Before, I couldn't even lift

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.200
a 2 kg weight over my head.
Now I can do it for reps.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.900
It's very specialised:
acupuncture and deep tissue massage,

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.300
all of these things, the fire cupping,
everything helped,

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:13.600
the ointments, and very natural
remedial things that he does

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.900
that I've never seen before,

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:21.900
and the extensive impact it had
on helping my recovery.
